      "value": "https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/replacing-youtube-dl-to-yt-dlpyoutube-dlyt-dlp\nApparently, updating the original git has slowed down, and forks integrating various patches are becoming the mainstream for development.\nI am not sure if this patch will join the original.\nBut indeed, the difference between the two updates for several months seems to be more than a negligible amount.",
