  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-11-01T02:14:10.095Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "As we all know, youtube-dl was taken down from github, and even though it still works, it can't receive updates for some time, and even before getting taken down it already had issues with a lot of websites since no pull requests were merged or at least gotten the privilege of being rejected, and the most recent commits have been extractors for either porn websites or youtube. \nThis has already resulted in almost half of youtube not being possible to be played on vrchat video players anymore.\nIn the meantime youtube-dlc has been maintained and I manually tested and it does fix most of the issues with youtube videos, so I suggest vrchat switches to youtube-dlc instead of youtube-dl to fix the numerous issues with video players in vrchat.",
